    "faqs": [
      {
        "q": "Can I earn rewards on co-branded online spends?",
        "a": "Most benefits on the card are provided on in-store purchases. SBI Card has not given clarity on whether online spends with these brands would be equally rewarded."
      },
      {
        "q": "What is the eligibility criteria to avail this credit card?",
        "a": "The income and other requirements to avail this credit card are at SBI Card’s discretion. However, a general requirement is that applicants must be aged between 18 and 60 years."
      },
      {
        "q": "Are there any applicable charges for UPI-linked transactions on this credit card?",
        "a": "No, there are no charges for linking UPI apps or making UPI-linked transactions via the Titan SBI Credit Card. For UPI-linked transactions at participating Titan stores, card users earn 6 reward points per Rs 100 spent."
      },
      {
        "q": "What is the partnered network for the Titan SBI Credit Card?",
        "a": "The card is available on RuPay and Visa networks."
      },
      {
        "q": "Does the card offer value-back on the Plan of Purchase at partner jewellery stores?",
        "a": "No, customers will not get any rewards points, cashback, or gift vouchers against the payment of the Plan of Purchase."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I redeem the gift voucher online?",
        "a": "All vouchers can be redeemed only at participating Titan Stores. The jewellery vouchers can be redeemed only at select jewelry stores: Tanishq, Mia, or Zoya stores. But other brands e-vouchers can be redeemed at both retail stores and websites at partner Titan brands—World of Titan, Taneria, Eyeplus, Skinn, Fastrack, Helios, or Irth stores. For Eyeplus, redemption of e-vouchers is only applicable at stores."
      }
    ]
  },
